@startuml Like_Sequence
actor User
participant Browser
participant AppServer
participant PostService
participant PostRepository
participant DB

User -> Browser: click 'Like' on FeedPost
Browser -> AppServer: POST /feed/{id}/like
AppServer -> LikeCommand: new LikeCommand(user_id, post_id)
LikeCommand -> PostService: execute()
PostService -> PostRepository: toggleLike(post_id, user_id)
PostRepository -> DB: INSERT or DELETE Like row
DB --> PostRepository: result
PostRepository --> PostService: updated like count
PostService -> FeedPublisher: notify(event: like)
FeedPublisher -> FollowerObserver: update(event)
PostService --> AppServer: updated like count
AppServer --> Browser: JSON { liked: true/false, like_count: N }

note right of PostService
  LikeCommand encapsulates the action (Command 패턴)
  PostService는 Facade 역할로 저장/알림을 조정
end note

@enduml
